{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "马鞍面与鞍点：梯度为零不一定是极值点",
    "goals": [
      "通过偏导数计算验证马鞍面在原点的梯度为零",
      "观察y=0与x=0两个截面切线，理解沿不同路径方向的升降差异",
      "运用任意邻域内的函数值正负比较，严谨证明鞍点既非极大也非极小"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "双截面对比：借助y=0与x=0截面的对立走向建立直觉",
        "路径参数化：将二维截面转化为一维路径t上的函数曲线进行对比",
        "邻域反例法：利用极小邻域内必定存在正负值的定义否定极值"
      ]
    }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "计算马鞍面原点偏导数与梯度，引入双方向截面观察梯度为零时的矛盾现象",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "承接上一课，我们来看马鞍面函数 f(x,y) = x² - y²。首先求偏导数：f_x = 2x，f_y = -2y。在原点(0,0)处，两个偏导数都为0，因此原点梯度为零。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "f(x,y) = x^2 - y^2 \\implies f_x(0,0)=0, \\ f_y(0,0)=0 \\implies \\nabla f(0,0) = (0,0)"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              }
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "强调原点偏导数计算结果与梯度为零"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "回想第一课的抛物面 x² + y²，它在原点同样梯度为零且是最低点。那么，梯度为零就一定是最低点吗？我们同时观察两幅马鞍面，两幅图的截面分别为 y=0 和 x=0。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "scene3d",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "截面 y=0",
                "fallback": "函数曲面 z=x^2 - y^2 与可变截面。",
                "axes": true,
                "camera": {
                  "yaw": 0.72,
                  "pitch": 0.55,
                  "zoom": 1
                },
                "objects": [
                  {
                    "as": "surface",
                    "kind": "surface",
                    "label": "z=x^2 - y^2",
                    "color": "teal",
                    "expression": "x^2 - y^2",
                    "x_range": {
                      "min": -2,
                      "max": 2
                    },
                    "y_range": {
                      "min": -2,
                      "max": 2
                    },
                    "samples": 12
                  }
                ],
                "sections": [
                  {
                    "as": "section",
                    "axis": "y",
                    "value": 0,
                    "targets": [
                      "surface"
                    ],
                    "display": "plane_and_intersection",
                    "label": "截面",
                    "color": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              }
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-02",
              "kind": "scene3d",
              "role": "comparison_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "截面 x=0",
                "fallback": "函数曲面 z=x^2 - y^2 与可变截面。",
                "axes": true,
                "camera": {
                  "yaw": 0.72,
                  "pitch": 0.55,
                  "zoom": 1
                },
                "objects": [
                  {
                    "as": "surface",
                    "kind": "surface",
                    "label": "z=x^2 - y^2",
                    "color": "teal",
                    "expression": "x^2 - y^2",
                    "x_range": {
                      "min": -2,
                      "max": 2
                    },
                    "y_range": {
                      "min": -2,
                      "max": 2
                    },
                    "samples": 12
                  }
                ],
                "sections": [
                  {
                    "as": "section",
                    "axis": "x",
                    "value": 0,
                    "targets": [
                      "surface"
                    ],
                    "display": "plane_and_intersection",
                    "label": "截面",
                    "color": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "right_of",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              }
            },
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-02-item-02",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-02",
      "purpose": "将截面降维为路径参数t的函数曲线，分析两个主方向上的极值差异",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "对于马鞍面，高度 z 等于 x 的平方减去 y 的平方。我们分别沿 x 轴和 y 轴方向取截面，观察截面上的一元函数。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
                "section-01-moment-02-item-02"
              ],
              "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "在 y 等于零的截面上，高度 z 等于 x 的平方。用路径参数 t 表示 x，高度就是 t 的平方。因此，在沿 x 轴的这条路径上，原点是最低点。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "y=0 \\implies z = x^2 \\implies z(t) = t^2 \\quad (t=x)"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "观察沿x方向开口向上的抛物线截面",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "在 x 等于零的截面上，高度 z 等于负的 y 平方。用路径参数 t 表示 y，高度就是负的 t 平方。因此，在沿 y 轴的这条路径上，原点反而是最高点。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "x=0 \\implies z = -y^2 \\implies z(t) = -t^2 \\quad (t=y)"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-02"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-02-item-02",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "现在把两条截面曲线放到同一坐标系中比较。横轴是路径参数 t，纵轴是高度 z。开口向上的抛物线，对应 x 等于 t、y 等于零的路径；开口向下的抛物线，对应 x 等于零、y 等于 t 的路径。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-04-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "截面路径参数曲线对照图",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -4,
                    "max": 4,
                    "label": "t"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -15,
                    "max": 15,
                    "label": "z"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "(x)^(2)",
                    "label": "(x,y)=(t,0)"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "curve-02",
                    "expression": "-((x)^(2))",
                    "label": "(x,y)=(0,t)"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-02"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-02-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "z(t,0) = t^2 \\text{ (t=0处极小)}, \\quad z(0,t) = -t^2 \\text{ (t=0处极大)}"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-04-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "比较两条方向相反极值特性的路径曲线",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-03",
      "purpose": "基于任意小邻域定义进行严格代数证明，说明鞍点非极值点的本质",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "我们来严格证明原点不是极值点。在原点任意小的邻域内，我们取两类特殊点：沿x轴的点(t,0)和沿y轴的点(0,t)，其中t不等于0。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-04-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "引出邻域内两类特殊点的代数式",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "代入函数，f(t,0)等于t的平方，大于0；f(0,t)等于负t的平方，小于0；而原点函数值f(0,0)等于0。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-03-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "f(t,0)=t^2>0, \\quad f(0,t)=-t^2<0, \\quad f(0,0)=0 \\quad (t \\neq 0)"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-04-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "因为这两类点可以任意靠近原点，所以在原点的任何邻域内，都同时存在比原点函数值更高和更低的点。这直接违背了局部极大值和局部极小值的定义。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-03-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "鞍点的代数本质",
                "items": [
                  "任意邻域内同时存在 f(x,y) > f(0,0) 与 f(x,y) < f(0,0)",
                  "一升一降即可否定极值点",
                  "注意：仅两个方向上升尚不能证明局部极小"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-03-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "因此，即便梯度为零，原点也既不是局部极大点，也不是局部极小点，这就是鞍点的本质。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-04-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "总结鞍点与梯度为零的关系",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-04",
      "purpose": "总结多元函数极值判断的三课方法体系，并进行概念反思与自查",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "今天我们总结多元函数极值分析的三种核心视角。第一，固定输出看等高线；第二，固定输入看偏导数；第三，通过比较经过同一点的不同路径，来判断该点是否为极值点。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-04-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "多元函数极值分析方法体系",
                "items": [
                  "固定输出：观察等高线形态与分布",
                  "固定输入：计算一阶偏导数与梯度",
                  "路径分析：比较过同一点的不同方向曲线"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-03-moment-03-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-04-moment-01-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "梳理多元函数极值分析的三大核心方法",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "我们将旋转抛物面 z 等于 x 平方加 y 平方，与马鞍面 z 等于 x 平方减 y 平方在原点处进行对比。两者的梯度在原点均为零向量，但极值性质截然不同。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-04-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "\\nabla z(0,0) = (0, 0)"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-04-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "对于旋转抛物面，除原点外，所有点的函数值 x²+y² 都严格大于零，因此原点是严格局部极小值点；而对于马鞍面，原点任意邻域内既存在正值也存在负值，因此原点不是极值点，而是鞍点。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-04-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "\\text{抛物面: } f(x,y) \\ge f(0,0) \\quad | \\quad \\text{马鞍面: } \\Delta f \\text{ 符号不固定}"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-04-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "最后留下一个概念自查思考题：如果一个曲面在某点沿 x 轴和 y 轴两个方向都达到局部极小，我们能否断言该点就是多元函数的局部极小值点？为什么？",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-04-moment-04-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "概念反思自查",
                "items": [
                  "问题：沿 x 轴和 y 轴方向均上升，能否断言局部极小？",
                  "思考：坐标轴方向能否代表全方位邻域的变化？"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-04-moment-03-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-05",
          "say": "答案是不能。因为坐标轴方向仅代表两个特定切平面方向。即便沿着 x 轴和 y 轴方向函数值都增加，在其他斜向路径上函数值仍可能减小。判断极小值必须保证在全方位完整邻域内函数值均不小于该点。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-04-moment-05-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "\\text{结论: 不能。必须满足 } \\forall (x,y) \\in U(p_0), f(x,y) \\ge f(p_0)"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-04-moment-04-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-04-moment-05-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "明确极值定义的邻域全方位性要求",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "本课通过分析马鞍面 z=x²-y²，证明了梯度为零仅是极值的必要条件而非充分条件。我们利用双方向截面和邻域定义揭示了鞍点的特性，并总结了结合等高线、偏导数与路径分析判断极值的完整方法。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-02-item-02",
      "section-02-moment-04-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
